; 2_ssg_example_c — Defender-style alert arpeggio (E minor, urgent)

T160
P2
V12
O5
L8

; phrase A — alert pattern
E G B > E  E G B > E
D F+ A > D  D F+ A > D

; phrase B — climb / urgency
L16
E G B > E  D F+ A > D  C E G > C  < B > D F+ A
G B > D F+  E G B > E  D F+ A > D  C E G > C
L8

; phrase C — resolve
> E < G > B > E  > D < B G E
F+ A > C+ F+  E D C < B
> E2 R4 R4

~
